{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And Moses said: Eat it today, etc.</b> In the morning, when they were accustomed to go out and gather, they came to ask: 'Shall we go out or not?' He said to them: Eat what is in your hand. In the evening they returned to him and asked him: What about going out? He said to them: Today is the sabbath. He saw them anxious lest the manna had ceased and would not fall again. He said to them: Today you will not find it. What does הַיּוֹם tell you? Today you will not find it — but tomorrow you will find it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:42.829528394Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}